          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">18. Severability</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">If any provision of these terms is found to be unenforceable by a Singapore court, that provision will be modified to the minimum extent necessary to make it enforceable. The remaining provisions will continue in full force and effect.</p>

          <h2 style="font-family: Sora, sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #0f172a; margin: 32px 0 16px;">19. Entire Agreement</h2>
          <p style="margin: 0 0 24px;">These Terms of Service, our Privacy Policy and any signed project proposal constitute the entire agreement between you and UWSM Pte Ltd regarding your engagement of Serpeyes and supersede any prior agreements or understandings.</p>

